u003c/strong\u003e Powered by a quad-core processor and 20 sensors, it maps your pool with precision. It doesn't just bounce around; it plans an S-shaped route for the floor and an N-shaped route for walls, ensuring 100% coverage with no missed spots.\u003c/p\u003e\u003cp\u003e\u003cstrong\u003eCordless Convenience:\u003c/strong\u003e The freedom from cords is its biggest selling point. It parks itself at the waterline when the battery is low or the cycle is finished, making retrieval easy. The charging dock is simple and unobtrusive.\u003c/p\u003e\"}}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"row mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-success h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-success text-white\",\"children\":\"Pros\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Unique surface skimming capability\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Completely cordless operation\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Advanced mapping technology\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Sleek, futuristic design\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"4\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Easy to retrieve with auto-parking\"}]]}]]}]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-md-6\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card border-danger h-100\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-danger text-white\",\"children\":\"Cons\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"0\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Newer brand with less long-term reliability data\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"1\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Premium price point\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"2\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Battery life limits cleaning time for massive pools\"}],[\"$\",\"li\",\"3\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item\",\"children\":\"Clarifying agent is a consumable cost\"}]]}]]}]}]]}],[\"$\",\"h3\",null,{\"className\":\"mt-5\",\"children\":\"Final Verdict\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"children\":\"The Beatbot AquaSense 2 is an ambitious and impressive machine. It attempts to do everything—and largely succeeds. The addition of surface skimming is a game-changer for pools near trees. If you are willing to invest in the latest technology and want a truly all-in-one cleaning solution, the AquaSense 2 offers a glimpse into the future of pool maintenance.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"col-lg-4\",\"children\":[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card sticky-top\",\"style\":{\"top\":\"20px\"},\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-body text-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"h5\",null,{\"className\":\"card-title\",\"children\":\"Beatbot AquaSense 2\"}],[\"$\",\"p\",null,{\"className\":\"card-text\",\"children\":\"Ready to buy? Get the best price online.\"}],[\"$\",\"a\",null,{\"href\":\"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0DPMDQ2RD?tag=scorpiusllc-20\",\"target\":\"_blank\",\"className\":\"btn btn-warning btn-lg fw-bold w-100 \",\"children\":\"Check Price on Amazon\"}],[\"$\",\"small\",null,{\"className\":\"text-muted d-block mt-2\",\"children\":\"We may earn a commission on qualifying purchases.\"}]]}],[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card mt-4\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"div\",null,{\"className\":\"card-header bg-light fw-bold\",\"children\":\"Consider These Alternatives\"}],[\"$\",\"ul\",null,{\"className\":\"list-group list-group-flush\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"li\",\"Aiper-Seagull-Pro\",{\"className\":\"list-group-item d-flex justify-content-between align-items-center\",\"children\":[[\"$\",\"$L7\",null,{\"href\":\"/reviews/Aiper-Seagull-Pro\",\"className\":\"text-decoration-none fw-bold\"